        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions ATC150SBR, Large Acrylic Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis large acrylic door pull is made by First Impressions and is available in 7 standard lengths ranging from 18 inches to 84 inches. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. Available in your choice of <b>Frosted or Crystal Clear Acrylic</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary design acrylic pull handle can be used on glass doors, store front doors, commercial office entry doors—-any door where a clean, contemporary large door handle is required. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Arctic Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATC01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262246\"><b>First Impressions ATC150SBR Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>FII-ATC150018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>FII-ATC150024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>FII-ATC150036SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>FII-ATC150048SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\" VALIGN=\"top\" >\r\n<b>FII-ATC150060SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>FII-ATC150072SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 72\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>FII-ATC150084SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 84\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arctic Large Acrylic Door Handle",
                "description": "First Impressions ATC150SBR - This large acrylic door pull is made by First Impressions and is available in 7 standard lengths ranging from 18 inches to 84 inches. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading. Available in your choice of Frosted or Crystal Clear Acrylic. This contemporary design  acrylic pull handle can be used on glass doors, store front doors, commercial office entry doors - any door where a clean contemporary large door handle is required. ",
